{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "birth_bdl_031tom_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "birth_bdl_031tom_009_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "a491a867ab1b97fd2dbc87b4c8e2178dbc055fa7d8c88336aae94eb0f1cdda9b", "ja": "今日の朋花ちゃんは、一段と輝いているな～。その\n神々しさ、茜ちゃんも思わず拝んじゃうよね……。", "zh": "今天的朋花格外耀眼呢～。那份神圣感，就连小茜也会忍不住拜上一拜吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "birth_bdl_031tom_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "birth_bdl_031tom_009_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "aae8017492b4c257859f97af3b588b42da751b2738f95925589a441fb31712f5", "ja": "朋花ちゃんはすごい子だけど、私たちの大切な妹でも\nあるんだから。困った事があったら、大人を頼ってね♪", "zh": "朋花虽然是个了不起的孩子，但她也是我们珍爱的小妹妹呀。有什么困难的话，要找大人帮忙哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "birth_bdl_031tom_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "birth_bdl_031tom_009_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "4753487de837dabd53101837991906efd117b3618f7c72a5323e9d8e0486d2e4", "ja": "うふふ、ありがとうございます～♪　齢を重ね、\nもっと大きな光になって、皆を包みこみますね～♪", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢您～♪　我又增长了一岁，\n会化作更耀眼的光芒，温柔包容大家的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "birth_bdl_031tom_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "birth_bdl_031tom_009_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5a8385e212aa80d6e8fec8fd6b69275056b927801f4ad0bf3d5bbb5cbac92f0a", "ja": "朋花、お疲れさま！\nそれから……。", "zh": "朋花，辛苦了！\n还有就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
